WEBVTT

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:28.060
<i>It was the year 1889.</i>

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:31.820
<i>After bidding farewell to the amazing submarine, Nautilus,</i>

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:34.860
<i>Jean, Nadia and King took off in Jean's plane and flew to an island.</i>

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.030
<i>When they were circling the skies over the island,</i>

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.570
<i>they were shot down by an unknown enemy and crashed in the forest.</i>

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:43.160
<i>While wandering on the island, they encountered Marie, a small girl.</i>

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:47.670
<i>Her parents were murdered by a mysterious organization.</i>

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.750
<i>The same organization has taken Grandis and her two men prisoner.</i>

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.010
<i>Jean's group was attacked by this enemy, but managed to elude them.</i>

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:58.890
<i>Jean and Nadia told Marie that her parents were killed by the enemy.</i>

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.510
<i>This was hard for Marie to understand.</i>

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.970
<i>Jean and Marie decided to take Marie under their protection.</i>

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.710
Let me see...

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:41.010
There's a big church near Marie's house.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:46.100
Let's see. Around this area?

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:51.020
Every Sunday, I used to go for prayers with Mama and Papa.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.310
I see. You're a good child.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.320
The location of the church is quite clear.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.910
Next, we must...

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.960
What's this?!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.260
Is that a robot pulling the vehicle?

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.310
No, the vehicle is operating the human tank.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:35.860
Neo Atlan!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.480
Neo Atlan.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.490
The kids have not been seen yet.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.610
The girl is not to be killed. Understand?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.490
Yes, Sir!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.120
Okay. Return to your post.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.120
Yes, Sir!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.210
Kids?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:57.170
Are they looking for us?
The girl is not to be killed?

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.670
They must be talking about Nadia. I see.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.840
Right! Next, the port.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.810
Let me see. The top is north of...

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.640
That must be the road Marie mentioned.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:13.730
Right!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.650
Port?

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.660
Yes, where there are lots of ships.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.030
I know where that is!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.200
If you go down the road by the side of the church,

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.910
you'll come to a place where there are many ships.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.790
Papa used to take me there all the time.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.960
I see. How nice for you.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.020
Security is too tight.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.570
I'll never be able to sneak in.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.570
So many boxes! I wonder what they contain?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.490
On top of that. they've got the place as bright as day.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.240
Even Paris didn't have this much light.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.620
Where are the power lines?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.920
They run toward the hills.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.340
What is that on top of that hill?

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.800
My goodnight kiss.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:12.560
Kiss?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.600
Don't you know? Mama always kisses me goodnight.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.360
Goodnight, Marie.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.900
Wrong!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.900
You must say "Night, Marie", like Mama does.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.530
Oh, I see.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.990
Night, Marie.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.370
Night, Mama.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.720
Don't worry. Good night, King.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.860
The village and port are full of soldiers.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.280
The islanders are with them too.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:11.030
What do you mean, islanders?

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.570
They're all horrible murderers.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.160
There must be some that haven't been captured by them yet.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.750
We have to join them.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.500
Then, tell me where such people are!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.830
They're...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.210
You don't know, do you?

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.000
Then, you tell me what I should do!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.210
Well, you can be more sure...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.420
Are you having a lovers' spat?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.800
No, we're not!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:38.020
Oh, Marie, I'm sorry. We aren't fighting.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.270
It's all right, nothing to worry about.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.270
I understand.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.240
Anyway, there's very little that the two of us can do.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.530
We have to think of Marie too.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.740
You don't have to tell me that!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.240
We mustn't put Marie in any danger.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.200
Their base is probably located in the middle of the open mine.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.420
I'll try to find out more tonight.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.340
Marie! You mustn't go outside. It's not safe!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.510
Wow! Look at the pretty flower garden!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.680
King! Sit!

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:26.560
You musn't go, Jean. It's too dangerous to go inside their base.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.400
It can't be helped.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.400
I believe the captured islanders are being kept there too, so...

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.320
You can't!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.280
Listen to me, Nadia.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:39.240
The only thing we know about this island is what we heard from Marie.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.750
It's the only data on this map.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.870
We have to get inside the base, and collect more information.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:45.540
But...

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:50.550
Don't worry. I've figured out how I can get in without being caught.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.210
But...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.220
Nadia...

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.890
We have to take risks if we want to get off of this island.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.390
A yellow one, and a white one and a red one!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.150
Look, King, aren't they pretty?

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:16.780
I'm going to make the prettiest necklace in Heaven for Mookie.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:22.160
Look at that pretty flower!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.880
Shall I get it for you, little girl?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.640
Mama! Mama!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.720
Get down!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.480
Mama! Mama!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.440
Help!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:52.570
Mar...

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.150
Stop that! We'll get caught if we go out now.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:10:00.240
They're waiting to see if anyone will come and try to save her.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.330
They're like animals.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.160
Mama! No! Mama!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.910
Looks like there's no one else, Sir.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.040
I see. We'll head back to our base.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.920
Yes, Sir! Everyone, get ready to move out!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.720
Darn them!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.640
Let's go, Nadia.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.100
Yes...

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.190
Marie, don't lose hope.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.240
We'll come and save you!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.250
That's the place. See the smoke?

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.040
I believe the secret base is located below the castle.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.960
That's where they've taken Marie and King.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.880
We'll get them out somehow.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.050
Let's go!

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.560
So they're using an old abandoned mine.

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.780
That's bright. When did you invent that?

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:22.320
Actually, I borrowed this from the Nautilus.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:36.500
This power cable should lead us to their base.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.010
Marie told us the power plant was quite large.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.180
Then this cable is full of electricity.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.100
Watch out!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.600
That's a high voltage line!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.230
It can kill you!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.950
What is it?!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.950
The exit?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.380
Just as I thought!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:17.090
This must be their base. Be careful now.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.310
They must all be island people.
I feel so sorry for them.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.520
Jean, over there.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.150
A lake!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.030
The secret base?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.530
Must be.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.080
That must be the power plant.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.250
Look at the number of chimneys!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.170
I wonder what that central tower can be?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.790
It can't be an antenna.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.000
It's sparkling.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.090
Could it be made of glass? What could it be for?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.430
Is that the castle over there?

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.050
Looks like it.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.850
I have to admit it's an amazing place, pipes all around.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.560
I wonder what they make in there?

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.350
Geez, Jean. Don't you have any idea?

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.810
No. We have to go lower.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:22.440
Let's go!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.910
What's this?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.830
It's a conveyer belt!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.620
What's it transporting?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.680
This is just too much for me.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.850
Senorita Grandis!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.350
So, this is where she was.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.190
Hey, you! I'm talking to you, wench!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.850
Get up, and get back to work!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:02.270
Why don't you pick up this shovel, and start digging?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.190
What?

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:06.570
You're a man making a weak girl like me do heavy labor.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.200
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.660
Why you!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.750
You!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.260
That's how you deal with him.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.220
You handled yourselves quite well.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:41.230
In this modern age, such hard labor is not fitting at all.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.360
I'll just borrow this.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:46.610
What? Geez...

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.990
Let's get out of this place!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.450
What's the matter?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:03.290
If you hate work that much, I'll take you to a nicer place.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.260
Where? To a fancy dinner party?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:13.180
That's right, in an underground jail with nothing to eat or drink.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:13.970
Take them away!

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:14.640
Yes, Sir!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.010
Come with me!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.350
You're hurting me! This is no way to treat a lady!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.100
Can't you be more gentle?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.480
You jerks! Let me go!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.940
Right, let's go!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.290
That's funny.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:49.050
Hey! Who stopped this conveyer? Keep it moving!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.760
Yes, Sir! Right away!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.730
Do we have to walk in here?

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.270
If we walk on top, they'll see us.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.190
We're going to follow this pipe to the castle.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.440
We'll get all dirty.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:11.070
Can't be helped. We're not going to a picnic.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.360
You're right, we have to rescue Marie.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.670
Nadia!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.340
Stop this!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.850
That hurt!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.780
It started moving all at once.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.150
Jean, look over there!

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.280
It's that sea monster!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.160
So, it really was a submarine!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.500
That's the one that attacked my father.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.500
Someone's coming out.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.540
Neo Atlan! Neo Man!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:11.590
Neo Atlan! Neo Man!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.260
Who can that guy be?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.220
He seems to be a very important person.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:28.270
Welcome back, Lord Gargoyle.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.030
What about the girl?

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.280
Sir, we have a hostage to use as bait.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:41.660
Hurry then. I don't care what means you use. Just get her alive!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.120
Yes, Sir!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.250
Looks like a huge organization.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.090
Neo Atlan? I wonder what it means?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.800
The blast furnace!

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.560
Nadia, we must go downward to escape!

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:13.980
If we fall, we'll be crushed!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.740
The heat!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.870
Jean, over here!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.250
Grab my hand! Hurry!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.610
How are adjustments on the artificial Orihalcon proceeding?

00:18:55.610 --> 00:19:00.660
It shows a delay of 0.01 percent, but it will be ready for the tests.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.700
It certainly is hot.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.500
We've got to bear it. We'll get caught walking outside.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.420
But if we fall in that, we won't last a second.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:14.880
That's for sure.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.890
Are you all right?

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:31.230
Yes, thanks.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.230
Geez...

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.020
Don't frighten me like that again.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.150
It's so hot.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:20:00.300
I see. They're making glass blocks from molten crystal. I wonder what for?

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.130
Is that all you can think about?

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:13.940
It's a very modern automated plant. No one's tending the machines.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.610
But there are guards.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.530
What's our next step?

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.450
When it gets dark, I think there will be fewer guards. Then...

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.870
Then we can get inside by traveling under the conveyor.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.790
As I stated in my report, the artificial Orihalcon

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:39.590
is a concentration of all the scientific knowledge we possess.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.920
Theoretically, it should perform in line with our original plans.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:47.640
Theories are of no use. It must be practical.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:54.980
What is this?!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.310
Why does it act like this?

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.740
What is it? What's happening?

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.320
I don't know. It's never acted like this before.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.130
It's never acted in this manner before!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.510
Check on this right away.
It must be reacting to something.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:22.380
Yes, Sir!

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:26.380
Could it be Nadia's Blue Water?

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.180
This is amazing!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.060
Oh, no!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.820
There they are! Hurry!

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:44.780
Hurry, this way!

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:45.860
Jean, the light!

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.700
There they go!

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.870
Stop! Stop, or I'll shoot!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.880
Jean!

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.220
Don't worry. It's just a scratch.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:13.220
Thanks.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.430
We know you're in there.

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:19.190
You are completely surrounded.

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:22.110
Come out with your hands up.

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.570
Darn it!

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:27.860
Look, Jean, over there.

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:32.490
It seems to lead somewhere.

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:35.250
Jean, listen.

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:41.380
When I go out, take this pendant, and slip into that opening.

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:46.630
I'm going to count to five. If you don't appear, we start shooting.

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:48.430
One!

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:51.680
I'll go out, and you...

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:54.310
I'm the one they're after.

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:55.930
Two!

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:02.810
I understand, but I'll come for you no matter what.

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:06.230
I'll be waiting.

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:07.360
Three!

00:23:09.740 --> 00:23:11.200
Nadia...

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:14.280
Four!

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:18.710
That was Mama's kiss.

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:21.960
Five!

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:29.130
Hold it! Don't fire! It's that girl we've been looking for! Take her alive!

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:33.890
After her! Don't let her get away!

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:35.560
She went that way!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:37.310
Go around the right side!

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:49.440
Nadia!
